  "title": "Southern Fried Catfish",
  "description": "This fried catfish recipe is made with fish fillets marinated in buttermilk and coated with Old Bay cornmeal, deep-fried until crisp and golden brown.",
  "authors": [
    "Mama Smith"
  ],
