  "ingredients": [
    "0.5 cup buttermilk",
    "0.5 cup water",
    "salt and pepper, to taste",
    "1 pound catfish fillets, cut in strips",
    "1.5 cups fine cornmeal",
    "0.5 cup all-purpose flour",
    "1 teaspoon seafood seasoning, such as Old Bay™",
    "1 quart vegetable oil for deep frying"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/zACb0jXciApU9JxLJH-fZr9h-qI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-140930-Southern-Fried-Catfish-step-0-61f90cb8c0024397aaa0392d54e7a668.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/140930/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix buttermilk, water, salt, and pepper in a small bowl. Pour mixture into a flat pan large enough to hold fillets.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/V0z59aw5dgW1gtuVNCDn1Ln_Z9Q=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-140930-Southern-Fried-Catfish-Step1-bf333ee4cb3d42c59fd09de5de0c099d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/140930/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Arrange fillets in a single layer in the pan, turning to coat each side. Set aside to marinate.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/9C07DkKISld_TWS6OnAYeNwKOg4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-140930-Southern-Fried-Catfish-Step2-bd7e888140934ce1ac123c400dbd9e68.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/140930/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine cornmeal, flour, and seafood seasoning in a 2-gallon resealable plastic bag.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/rDYXyS2GhwpAS7W5Qc4EYRAYjAg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-140930-Southern-Fried-Catfish-Step3-ef59f3b8ff2d425faee74b8128b5bbf8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/140930/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add fillets to the bag, a few at a time, and tumble gently until evenly coated.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/C_mVxqdAm1xFCYoElC4QDBRSDD0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-140930-Southern-Fried-Catfish-Step4-83d109e2659d461e9abd03fb3ac241fd.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/140930/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat oil in a deep fryer to 365 degrees F (185 degrees C). Fry fillets in hot oil until crisp and golden brown, about 3 minutes. Work in batches to avoid overcrowding, so fillets have room to brown properly.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/vJiJmylBPuUO6jYEH5jvU7B73rY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-140930-Southern-Fried-Catfish-Step5-926f988a1d9345a4b245cc01b0e880e0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/140930/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Drain on paper towels.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/YrFzkZRW0WWb1CumaDuZEvG6v7k=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-140930-Southern-Fried-Catfish-Step6-48c590dc9f704176841fba8c21d7fc96.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/140930/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/4Zilyeyqtz4shmiKprMpRdnm_cM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-140930-Southern-Fried-Catfish-Beauty-4x3-70c5e0d8071248afbe4184fb4f33f6dc.jpg"
      ],
